Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.57,0:00:07.99,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I made it a bit on the sweet side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.99,0:00:10.07,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you, Philine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.37,0:00:19.60,Flashback,Aquasteed FB,0,0,0,,What is that light?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.06,0:00:28.09,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,There hasn't been a report \Nfrom the castle yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:32.89,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What will Prince Aqua do when \Nhe finds out it was the Holy Prayer?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.39,0:00:37.35,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Assuming things follow the game's story...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.39,0:00:41.78,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua is a route \Nintroduced in the sequel,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:43.65,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,so that shouldn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.34,0:00:47.85,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But now that the game's practically over,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.85,0:00:50.07,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,what if we're moving \Non to the sequel now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:07.32,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:11.90,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,I'm told that the light we saw earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:14.72,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,was the result of defective \Nmagical equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.98,0:01:17.07,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,And Lady Tiararose \Nis asked to return home
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.07,0:01:23.30,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,until the castle's inspection \Nof said equipment is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.30,0:01:25.45,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I see. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.10,0:01:30.99,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,So it was defective magical equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.99,0:01:32.93,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I'm glad it was nothing serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.03,0:01:36.44,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara, I'll see you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.10,0:01:39.50,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,All right, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.12,0:01:42.30,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'd really rather not go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.87,0:01:46.35,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I want to see for myself \Nwhere the game goes next.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.13,0:01:52.16,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I just hope Prince Aqua doesn't \Ntake the heroine's hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.69,0:02:11.44,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an2\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs28\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(604,100)\t(20,4733,\fs23)\move(336,79,336,93,20,4733)\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&H5280F6&)\t(3191,3191,\c&HACF29E&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H19D3F7&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HFC8A3D&)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}Is {\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&HEF65A0&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H7B72F5&)\t(3399,3399,\c&HEFF400&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HB36BF7&)}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.77,0:03:28.98,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(560,1)\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\pos(320,123)\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&H343E6B&}The {\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Sweetest Kiss{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}in the {\c&HFC8A3D&}{\b1}World{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.86,0:03:32.81,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.36,0:03:36.15,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I've just returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.41,0:03:39.13,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,That took a long time. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.91,0:03:40.96,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.55,0:03:43.00,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I was surprised to learn that Lady Akari,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.00,0:03:47.52,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,the girl by Prince Hartknights's side \Nat the graduation party,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.52,0:03:49.96,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,has learned to use the Holy Prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.13,0:03:53.71,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It can't be... Lady Akari did?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.57,0:04:01.22,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,This has become rather problematic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:03.32,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Akari, of all people...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:07.73,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,The Holy Prayer is \Na power desired by all nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:09.93,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,The benefits it brings are so great
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.93,0:04:13.23,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,that any nation possessing it \Ncan enjoy total peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.53,0:04:17.79,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes, which is why those who \Ncan use it often marry royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.25,0:04:20.97,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Every royal family wants \Nto make it their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.97,0:04:22.22,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.81,0:04:27.93,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,It's likely that Lapis Lazuli will make \Nthat girl marry Prince Hartknights
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.93,0:04:30.48,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,so that they won't ever lose her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.99,0:04:32.24,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Probably so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:37.03,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,But we can at least use the power \Nof Marinforest to intervene.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.03,0:04:41.26,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,If we can obtain the Holy Prayer, \Nour nation will prosper even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:45.21,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,The girl who can use the Holy Prayer, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:47.35,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I want her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.85,0:04:53.94,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It's been ten days since then,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:57.49,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,but I still know nothing \Nabout the Holy Prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:05:03.02,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Since my father is the prime minister, \NI'm sure he knows...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.63,0:05:07.58,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,but I can't ask him about something \Nthe royal family is keeping quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.98,0:05:11.12,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,"I actually know about the Holy Prayer!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:14.36,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I can't tell him that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:17.56,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I haven't seen Prince Aqua \Nsince that day either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:21.40,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Does he not know about \Nthe Holy Prayer yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:25.10,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Or... if he does know about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.43,0:05:27.15,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.15,0:05:30.41,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Preparations to depart \Nfor Marinforest are complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:32.55,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,You can go there whenever you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:37.52,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Of course, I will \Naccompany you all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:39.83,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you, Philine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:43.12,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,But when will you be departing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.12,0:05:47.79,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Isn't it nearly time for Prince Aquasteed \Nto return home as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.67,0:05:50.08,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:55.80,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It's so frustrating that I can't do \Nanything but await word from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:05.98,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Why isn't Prince Aqua here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.23,0:06:09.36,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I thought once he saw \Nthe Holy Prayer's power,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:13.92,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,he'd immediately say he wants me \Nand head here to get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.74,0:06:18.75,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,And then I go to Marinforest \Nwith Prince Aqua,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:21.13,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,and then we get married!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:24.78,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Or that's what I expected, \Nbut it's been two weeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:29.03,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Darn it, Prince Aqua! \NJust get here already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:44.39,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Philine, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.39,0:06:47.00,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,It looks absolutely delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:48.51,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.52,0:06:55.84,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua is coming to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:07:00.48,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The details must have \Nfinally been decided... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.75,0:07:02.82,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:05.82,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Father didn't say anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:07.68,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,so I'm sure he won't bring bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.89,0:07:11.58,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I hope Prince Aqua will like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:18.46,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I haven't been able to \Ncome here very much of late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.75,0:07:21.71,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,The preparations \Nhave been taking up all my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.71,0:07:24.72,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Please, don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.69,0:07:34.06,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I wonder what's wrong with Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:40.90,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,The truth is, the engagement \Nhas been settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.84,0:07:43.73,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Akari's, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:45.23,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.85,0:07:48.91,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Lady Akari and... whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.98,0:07:52.73,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It wouldn't surprise me \Nif he's been working
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.73,0:07:55.80,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,to get his hands on the Holy Prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.88,0:07:59.69,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,So then... it's going to happen again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.24,0:08:03.47,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,No! Please, don't take \NPrince Aqua from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:05.53,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,{\t(1264,2223,\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Anything but that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.55,0:08:12.14,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Akari and Prince Hartknights \Nare now formally engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.94,0:08:16.12,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,He's the man who hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.48,0:08:18.69,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I imagine you feel conflicted \Nabout this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:23.21,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It's not... with Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:26.99,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.39,0:08:31.32,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I was just so relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.10,0:08:36.44,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I thought you were getting \Nengaged to Lady Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.44,0:08:37.83,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I was so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.13,0:08:39.87,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Why would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:43.09,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I would never choose anyone but you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.07,0:08:46.46,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I made you feel so uneasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:49.19,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Come now, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.19,0:08:50.70,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:53.51,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.71,0:09:02.46,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:05.13,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara, I missed you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.13,0:09:06.49,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,As did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:11.75,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.20,0:09:16.49,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Thank goodness Prince Aqua \Ndidn't choose Lady Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.90,0:09:20.47,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm taking you with me to Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:24.59,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You'll stay by my side \Nfor the rest of our lives, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.59,0:09:27.44,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Of course, Prince Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.72,0:10:05.96,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Good evening, Lady Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.36,0:10:08.47,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady... Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:16.97,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs24\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(516,1)\pos(328,51)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&}Is {\c&HB36BF7&}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:26.19,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Good evening, Lady Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:29.02,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady... Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.35,0:10:32.69,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,You know, I've given it a lot of thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.47,0:10:37.03,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Lady Tiara, you're a player \Nof this game, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.62,0:10:39.91,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(476,1)\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\c&HAF88CE&\3c&HFFFFFF&\fs30\b1}The Ring {\c&HAFADA7&}of {\c&HE4A7A9&}Lapis Lazuli
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:46.88,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The game... \NSo Lady Akari really is like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:50.78,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I mean, you're the only thing \Nthat differs from the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.78,0:10:53.00,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Everything else went according \Nto the game's events,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.00,0:10:55.59,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,but the ending didn't go right at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:11:00.18,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Um... I'm not sure I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.18,0:11:02.19,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,There's no need to play dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.84,0:11:08.40,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Here I was planning to marry \NPrince Hartknights and be happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:11.69,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,but then along came my \Nfavorite, Prince Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.69,0:11:14.00,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:19.21,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,But Prince Aqua is \Nthe main route in the sequel,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.21,0:11:23.15,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,so I thought I'd be content with \NPrince Hartknights, my second favorite...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.15,0:11:27.21,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,but if I can marry Prince Aqua, \NI'd obviously rather have him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:32.54,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,You don't even know anything \Nabout the sequel, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:36.17,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,About the adorable \Nheroine in Marinforest?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:37.36,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.68,0:11:39.10,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.10,0:11:42.68,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I was trying to trick you into \Nadmitting it. I'm so glad it worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:46.97,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I reincarnated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:51.69,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I remember playing \Nthe game, but that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.69,0:11:54.80,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Hmm... So that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.80,0:11:57.58,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,you died before even playing the sequel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.58,0:11:59.28,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,That's unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:04.68,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,You poor thing! There's no otome game \Nout there anywhere near as amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.68,0:12:06.50,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Prince Hartknights is great,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:10.29,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,but Prince Aqua in the sequel \Nis so, {\i1}so{\i0} much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:14.95,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,The sequel's heroine is a duke's \Ndaughter in Marinforest named Icilla,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.95,0:12:16.90,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,and just when Prince Aqua \Nis feeling fed up with
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:20.80,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,the fiancée the state chose for him, \Nhe meets her on the seashore!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:23.13,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The sequel's heroine?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.92,0:12:26.43,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,The event CG for that scene is just {\i1}gorgeous{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.43,0:12:28.84,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I lost track of how \Nmany times I played it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.46,0:12:35.11,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Anyway, I think you know this, \Nbut I can use the Holy Prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:40.70,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,And if I tell my beloved Prince Aqua \Nthat, I'll be able to marry him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:44.62,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,So please break up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.62,0:12:45.58,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:46.79,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.79,0:12:49.39,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I love him so much {\i1}more{\i0} than you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.39,0:12:51.81,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,and I played the game so many times!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.81,0:12:55.29,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua is not a game! He's a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.29,0:12:58.14,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I know that, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:13:02.09,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But the way you're looking at this \Nignores his wishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:04.13,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.13,0:13:07.29,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,As the crown prince of a major \Ncountry, once he finds out,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:09.75,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,he'll obviously want me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.65,0:13:12.02,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,So just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.90,0:13:17.32,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.89,0:13:20.06,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I was thinking, what about a scenario
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.06,0:13:24.03,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,where Lady Tiara gets injured \Nand her engagement is called off?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.28,0:13:29.37,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It'll only make you \Nfall asleep a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.37,0:13:30.83,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,You can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:33.54,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You know you'll never get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.54,0:13:36.30,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Well, I'm the heroine,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.30,0:13:41.30,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,so when it's all well and truly over, \NI'm getting the happy ending!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.43,0:13:48.09,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Come forth, thunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.19,0:14:03.26,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Thank goodness. \NLooks like I made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:06.24,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:08.40,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Wh-Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:11.20,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,is Prince Aqua here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.31,0:14:17.46,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I see I wasn't in time after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.37,0:14:21.21,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,What is going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.31,0:14:25.72,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Akari, you will \Nexplain this, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.72,0:14:28.03,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,It's not what you think, Prince Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.03,0:14:31.30,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I've learned how to use the Holy Prayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.30,0:14:35.61,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,But it looks like I'll be forced \Nto marry Prince Hartknights...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.61,0:14:37.73,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Please save me, Prince Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.13,0:14:41.30,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Take me with you to your kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.74,0:14:43.50,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,What gives you the right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.50,0:14:46.99,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,You love Prince Hartknights, do you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.99,0:14:50.03,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Stay out of this, Marquis Clamentile!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.68,0:14:54.19,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua, won't having me \Nand my Holy Prayer
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.19,0:14:56.00,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,make your kingdom even more prosperous?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:00.51,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,No! Please don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.51,0:15:03.05,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Not Prince Aqua! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.01,0:15:06.51,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.37,0:15:13.64,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I know you are in possession \Nof the Holy Prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.64,0:15:18.15,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Then why didn't you make me your fiancée?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.66,0:15:20.90,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.23,0:15:25.31,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I can lead my kingdom to prosperity \Neven without your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:28.66,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,So I don't need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.06,0:15:31.11,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,The only one I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.23,0:15:35.65,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,is Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.86,0:15:39.39,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.25,0:15:41.61,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Lies...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.60,0:15:44.47,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,All lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.47,0:15:47.34,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,There's no way you wouldn't choose me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:49.59,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Apprehend her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.88,0:15:59.01,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're all right. \NDo you have any other injuries?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.01,0:16:03.83,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,No. I'm safe because \Nyou came to my rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.83,0:16:06.59,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,And this thing on my cheek \Nis just a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.03,0:16:08.35,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.35,0:16:09.84,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Just stay like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.55,0:16:13.60,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,After what you've been through,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:16.04,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,you're welcome to be \Na little more demanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.51,0:16:22.27,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua, thank you so much \Nfor coming to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:29.78,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Why do I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:33.76,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,have to live in a place like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.10,0:16:40.56,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I was spared from more serious punishment \Nthanks to Lady Tiara, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.32,0:16:42.46,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Come, water!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.68,0:16:53.85,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,As long as I'm in here, this is \Nabout the strongest magic I can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.85,0:16:58.09,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,If this were an otome game, \Na prince would come to save me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.74,0:17:01.79,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Wait, this {\i1}is{\i0} an otome game!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:04.25,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.27,0:17:07.94,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Prince Hartknights!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.76,0:17:10.73,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,You came for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.16,0:17:13.50,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I'll prepare tea right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.35,0:17:16.57,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I won't be staying that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.57,0:17:17.77,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.21,0:17:19.93,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I {\i1}want{\i0} to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.93,0:17:22.19,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,It's so boring here, I can't stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.63,0:17:27.61,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,You and I will be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.79,0:17:30.86,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Okay, understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.79,0:17:34.62,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,You accepted that rather easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:39.61,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I heard that you... \Nhad feelings for Prince Aquasteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:43.40,Italics,Akari INT,0,0,0,,Of course, Prince Aqua is my favorite,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.92,0:17:47.13,Italics,Akari INT,0,0,0,,but Prince Hartknights is mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.99,0:17:50.92,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I love you, too, Prince Hartknights.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:54.71,Italics,Akari INT,0,0,0,,Call me impudent,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.71,0:18:00.14,Italics,Akari INT,0,0,0,,but I love everything \Nabout this otome game world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:02.89,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I love you a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.53,0:18:06.65,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.40,0:18:13.15,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I'll go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.91,0:18:26.95,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Bring that luggage over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.95,0:18:32.91,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed, please \Ntake care of our daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.30,0:18:37.63,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I will, of course, \Nand I will make her happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.00,0:18:41.32,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm already so happy, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.32,0:18:45.77,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua, I'm already \Nvery happy, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:48.73,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,Well, you got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.34,0:18:52.24,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Preparations to depart are complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.35,0:18:56.66,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,You're going already? We'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.21,0:18:59.28,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,After I complete \Na year of bridal training,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.28,0:19:03.66,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'll return here briefly \Nfor my debutante party.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:07.38,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You can look forward to \Nlots of gifts from Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.43,0:19:10.13,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.52,0:19:13.01,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,Be well, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.01,0:19:15.38,Default,Iltiana,0,0,0,,Don't do anything too reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:19.89,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I won't. \NTake care of yourselves, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.61,0:19:26.12,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,You, too, Philine. Be well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:31.07,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Thank you. I will support \NLady Tiararose to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:36.78,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,My heart is pounding \Nin a way it never has before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.78,0:19:38.15,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,We're off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.64,0:19:57.05,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,There are fairies in \NMarinforest, aren't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.05,0:20:01.01,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm sure they'll \Ngive you their blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.01,0:20:03.18,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I can't wait to meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.90,0:20:08.90,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I was too embarrassed to do it before,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:11.61,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,but I want to try demanding his attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.85,0:20:16.14,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.42,0:20:20.95,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Never mind! \NThis is as much as I can take!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.48,0:20:28.48,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Oh, Tiara, you really are just too cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:33.46,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.59,0:20:37.42,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,A letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.86,0:20:42.22,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It's to you, from Lady Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.86,0:20:44.35,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,From Lady Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.93,0:20:48.31,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It's too suspicious. \NI'm sorry, but I'll check it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.66,0:20:52.13,Italics,Akari INT,0,0,0,,Dear Lady Tiara,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.66,0:20:57.33,Italics,Akari INT,0,0,0,,This letter is the strongest magic \NI'm able to use in the white tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.79,0:21:02.53,Italics,Akari INT,0,0,0,,I'm going to do my best to be happy \Nwith Prince Hartknights,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.53,0:21:05.98,Italics,Akari INT,0,0,0,,so please find your happiness, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:12.46,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I feel this is a bit \Ntoo convenient, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.21,0:21:21.21,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\c&H3F5479&\3c&HF0F0F0&\frz343.2\move(372,299,369,203,24,3527)}If you lose to the sequel's heroine,\NI'll never forgive you!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.21,0:21:25.21,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\c&H3F5479&\3c&HF0F0F0&\fs30\frz344.2\pos(345,127)}If you lose to the sequel's heroine,\NI'll never forgive you!!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.28,0:21:20.61,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Is this... Japanese?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:24.91,Italics,Akari INT,0,0,0,,If you lose to the sequel's heroine, \NI'll never forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.03,0:21:31.59,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua, may I keep this letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.59,0:21:33.36,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Well, I don't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.75,0:21:37.28,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,If I ever feel discouraged, \NI'll look at this to cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:44.96,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I won't lose to the sequel heroine \NI haven't even met yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.33,0:21:52.78,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,The crown prince has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.93,0:21:57.18,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Now, I wonder what sort of girl \Nhe's brought home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:39.98,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&H343E6B&\blur4\bord1\pos(320,123)}The {\c&HFC8A3D&\b1}Mermaid{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Knows Not of {\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Love{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.97,0:23:39.98,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&H343E6B&\bord1.75\pos(320,123)}The {\c&HFC8A3D&\b1}Mermaid{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Knows Not of {\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Love{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.57,0:23:34.39,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm so happy I get to see the ocean \Nwith Prince Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.39,0:23:36.77,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Who's that smiling on the beach?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.77,0:23:39.41,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Could it be... the sequel's heroine?!
